{"createdAt":"2026-10-01T03:25:29.118Z","data":{"body":[{"_key":"p4","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p0","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"日本ではMinecraftカップというマイクラ教育版のコンテストがあるわけなんですが、海外にもそういった事例はあり、マレーシアでは、MEC(Minecraft Education Challenge)というイベントがあります。"},{"_key":"p2","_type":"span","marks":["p1"],"text":"MEC 2023"},{"_key":"p3","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"に出場し、準優勝しました。"}],"markDefs":[{"_key":"p1","_type":"link","href":"https://mcedumy.com/mec-2023"}],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"p6","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"p5","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"マレーシアのマイクラカップ！？"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pa","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"事前審査を通過した作品が、当日の決勝大会に選ばれ、スポンサーのSunway Mallsの会場でイベントが開催されました&#xA;"},{"_key":"pa-g1","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWKCDXPY7N2742Y9WHVXC","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/eb6ed74013164ea94c82f8d6255f0e81ea19e627219667f421907ab79d61636e.jpg"},"height":3072,"link":{"href":"../../media/eb6ed74013164ea94c82f8d6255f0e81ea19e627219667f421907ab79d61636e.jpg"},"width":4080},{"_key":"pa-g2","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;教育省の関係者の方とかが直々に挨拶に来ていたり、初回にしてはずいぶん力の入っているイベントでした。"},{"_key":"pd","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWMTKAV65BE0DVBYY40CP","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/c7147f76ef0b327fa14234c58a69abd35bd1dff84e1f8692e9a98af1c6cc1671.jpg"},"height":4080,"link":{"href":"../../media/c7147f76ef0b327fa14234c58a69abd35bd1dff84e1f8692e9a98af1c6cc1671.jpg"},"width":3072},{"_key":"pd-g1","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;めちゃめちゃでかいトロフィーももらえました。"},{"_key":"pg","_type":"image","alt":"Image from Gyazo","asset":{"_ref":"01M3TNWSE3SS3ZCF3TAXEYVRW0","_type":"reference","url":"../../media/1fcabf8ff478226a3f9e50cbd734b46d08f1c119d9b64deebde8db50c120b771.jpg"},"height":4080,"link":{"href":"../../media/1fcabf8ff478226a3f9e50cbd734b46d08f1c119d9b64deebde8db50c120b771.jpg"},"width":3072},{"_key":"pg-g1","_type":"poc_markdown","body":"&#xA;NAIB JOHAN(準優勝)のボードを持って撮影しました。"},{"_key":"pi","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"ph","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"2025年になって..."}],"markDefs":[],"style":"h2"},{"_key":"pk","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pj","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"というわけでこれから2年ほど経って、今日本でマイクラカップの運営の手伝いをしているわけですが、海外、特にアジアでもこういう情報教育や、デジタルものづくりの教育の重要性とかが認識されているわけで、マイクラってこういうところにすごく使えるなと思っています。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"pm","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pl","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"実際自分が出場してみて思いましたが、まだまだ日本と比べると作品のレベルとかはそこまで高いわけではないし、都市部からの出場者が大半を占めていたので、地域の格差を感じました（ただ、マレーシアはとても広い国なので、これを埋めていくのはすごく大変ですが）"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"},{"_key":"po","_type":"block","children":[{"_key":"pn","_type":"span","marks":[],"text":"今はマイクラカップも日本に限定していて、海外ブロックもそこまで応募者数が多いわけではありませんが、今後海外に出ていくというのもありなんじゃないかなと。"}],"markDefs":[],"style":"normal"}],"date_precision":"day","description":"製作したマインクラフトのワールドが、マレーシア教育省、サンウェイ・モールズ、マイクロソフトが主催するマインクラフト教育チャレンジのInternational高学年部門で2位に選ばれました。","emoji":"🏆","hidden_from_listing":false,"is_work_in_progress":false,"properties":{},"published_updated_at":"2023-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","title":"Minecraftエデュケーションチャレンジ2023 準優勝","translation":null},"id":"01M3TQXS4YWPA1MA573BFHN66Q","locale":"ja","publishedAt":"2023-10-25T00:00:00.000Z","seo":{"canonical":null,"description":null,"image":null,"noIndex":false,"title":null},"slug":"minecraft-edu-challenge","terms":{"category":[{"id":"01M40J9GNQY5HF6H0X8B4QY5P2","label":"実績","locale":"ja","name":"category","parentId":null,"slug":"accomplishments","translationGroup":"01M40J9GCB4KBNP4JBE1Q966AV"}],"tag":[{"id":"01M40J9N10TT82N74A5S6S6YRC","label":"awarded","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"awarded","translationGroup":"01M40J9MR75XCKK5YXRKD009GJ"},{"id":"01M40J9R33GQD7WSQKZD0DXB4M","label":"educaiton","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"educaiton","translationGroup":"01M40J9QTJQN169MDKD5GB86KQ"},{"id":"01M40J9JEJ5CXD3G7BKQJNYPDP","label":"Minecraft","locale":"ja","name":"tag","parentId":null,"slug":"minecraft","translationGroup":"01M40J9J6G87KGQS79AT9ZGF54"}]},"translationGroup":"01M3TQXS4YWPA1MA573BFHN66Q"}
